; Rescued, not a starter: the Scorched Sands' chapter wizard, freed by kindling the three signal beacons round his
; tomb at once (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.6). Architect of the first pyramid, physician, High Priest of Ra. His
; passive is Surveyor, the one axis no other wizard owns: the reach at which orbs and pickups come to him (+20%).
; He opens on Fireball, the Long Coil's deed, pure Fire - which he shares with the Pyromancer (R1: their spells
; differ). The form deepens Fire.
